---
import { registrationPlatformLabel } from '../../../shared/registration-platform-label.mjs';
const { race } = Astro.props;
const platform = registrationPlatformLabel(race.registration?.platform);
---
<section class="perf-measurement-panel" data-measurement-ready-panel>
  <div class="wrap perf-measurement-wrap">
    <div class="perf-measurement-card reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">Measurement-ready handoff</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Know which registration path runners choose.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Each official-registration CTA is prepared for a `register_click` event with placement, platform, and destination metadata.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="perf-measurement-points" aria-label="Measurement details">
        <article>
          <strong>What the race site can report</strong>
          <p>Outbound registration handoff intent: which CTA sent a visitor toward {platform} and where that CTA appeared on the page.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <strong>What stays with registration</strong>
          <p>Race entry, payment, and confirmation remain inside the official registration platform unless later reporting or an approved integration is connected.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
